                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْصَلَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He made,</i> or <i>caused, him,</i> or <i>it, to
reach; he caused to come, brought, conveyed,</i> or
<i>delivered, him,</i> or <i>it;</i> (S, * M, K, *) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَيْهِ</span>
                        <i>to him,</i>
or <i>it;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَصَّلَهُ</span></b> . (M.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدَّاهُ</span>.

